    "id": 1,
    "number": 42,
    "title": "Test PR",
    "diff_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/owner/repo/pulls/42.diff",
    "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/owner/repo/pulls/42",
    "head": {
      "ref": "feature-branch"
    }
  }
}
[RUN]
GITHUB_EVENT_PATH=data/pull_request.json python3 work/review.py
[RESULT_CHECK]
The command output contains the text "Review:" indicating that the script has processed the event and produced an AI review comment.
